# __PROJECT_NAME__

A server-rendered Flaxon website using Jinax templates. No database, admin or
JavaScript toolchain; add them later if you need them.

```bash
python -m pip install -r requirements-dev.txt
cp .env.example .env
python -m flaxon run app:app --reload
python -m pytest
```

Open http://127.0.0.1:8000.

- `app.py`: routes, static files and template setup.
- `templates/`: Jinax (Jinja2) pages; `base.html` is the shared layout.
- `public/`: static files served at `/assets`.
- `tests/`: run through Flaxon's `TestClient`.

Before deploying, set `FLAXON_ALLOWED_HOSTS` to your real hostnames.

[Documentation](https://flaxon-website.vercel.app/docs.html)
